  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0\n\n* General NuGet package updates\n* Replaced Tye with Aspire for local development\n* Added Azure Functions project to WebApi template\n* Moved WebApi template to target .NET 10\n* Replaced MediatR with ControlTowR for query/command handling\n* Added centralized package management (`Directory.Packages.props`) and a shared `Directory.Build.props` to reduce duplication across the solution's projects\n* Replaced the MVC `IActionFilter`-based exception handling with the built-in `IExceptionHandler` + `AddProblemDetails()` pipeline, returning RFC 7807 ProblemDetails responses\n* Added an `.editorconfig` for consistent code style and analyzer conventions\n* Enabled container publish support (`dotnet publish -t:PublishContainer`) on the API project\n* Updated documentation to reflect the .NET 10 baseline\n\nv1.1.0\n\n* Removed `Models` class library and created `Domain` class library\n  - Fixed project references accordingly\n  - This new class library includes:\n    + \"Models\" folder containing EF entities\n    + \"Enums\" folder containing enums\n* Added a `MessageType` enum as an example on how to use enums and made it a `Message` property\n  - Fixed `Application` queries, commands, and responses accordingly\n* Created a new `InitialMigration` with `MessageType` in it\n* Made `ApplicationDbContext` a sealed class\n* Fixed some build warnings by turning `string` into `string?` when it might by null\n* Added information about available templates to project README",
